            "Your **90-Day Military Calisthenics Progression PDF** is ready.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 **[Download the PDF](sandbox:/mnt/data/90_Day_Military_Calisthenics_Plan.pdf)**\n\nThis includes:\n- A clear **90-day progression** broken into 3 phases (Foundation, Build, Performance)  \n- **15\u201320 minute daily structure**\n- **Weekly military-style split**\n- Simple execution rules so it stays disciplined and realistic\n\nIf you want, I can next:\n- Add a **printable daily checkbox calendar**\n- Create a **women-specific version** (joint friendly, core-focused)\n- Add a **fat-loss or endurance emphasis**\n- Brand it with a **cover page and logo** for sharing or selling\n\nJust tell me how far you want to take it."
